# __NAME__

A small Rastrillo app: one page, no database, no sign-in, and no design
system, for an app that writes its own HTML or JSON.

    go run ./cmd/__NAME__ -addr 127.0.0.1:8080
    go test ./...

Add a page: a route and its handler in internal/__PKG__/app.go. When
the app needs to store data, start again with
`rastrillo new --scaffold single` and move your pages across.
